{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_42","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba skills/mission/SKILL.md | sed -n '500,545p'\"","aggregated_output":"   500\t\n   501\t## Phase 8: Build Loop\n   502\t\n   503\t> **Rules:** 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9\n   504\t> **Goal:** Build all tasks with per-task validation.\n   505\t> **Inputs:** tasks.md, contract.md, design.md, proposal.md, config.yaml, UBIQUITOUS_LANGUAGE.md\n   506\t> **Outputs:** Committed code per task, validation reports in mission/validations/. Codebase deltas are internal (populate subsequent task briefs within this phase).\n   507\t\n   508\tFor each unchecked task (`- [ ]`) in tasks.md, run Steps 1-7. Process tasks in order, one at a time (serial execution). Skip tasks marked `- [~]` (skipped) and `- [x]` (complete).\n   509\t\n   510\t### Step 1: Assemble Brief\n   511\t\n   512\tWrite a brief to `mission/briefs/task-N.md`.\n   513\t\n   514\t#### Brief Template\n   515\t\n   516\tRead [templates/worker-brief.md](templates/worker-brief.md).\n   517\t\n   518\t**The brief NEVER contains contract.md content.** \n   519\t\n   520\t### Step 2: Dispatch Worker\n   521\t\n   522\tRead the engine from `mission/config.yaml`.\n   523\t\n   524\t#### If engine is `codex`:\n   525\t\n   526\tBefore dispatching, run `git rev-parse HEAD` and store the result as `PRE_TASK_SHA`. This value is used in Step 7 to generate the codebase delta — store it somewhere you can reference after the background worker returns (e.g. in the plan file or a local variable).\n   527\t\n   528\tUse the Bash tool with `run_in_background: true` to run the worker. Use this exact bash script:\n   529\t\n   530\t```bash\n   531\tBRIEF_PATH=\"<absolute path to mission/briefs/task-N.md>\"\n   532\tHANDOFF_PATH=\"<absolute path to mission/handoffs/task-N.md>\"\n   533\tLOG_PATH=\"<absolute path to mission/logs/task-N-codex.log>\"\n   534\tPRE_TASK_SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD)\n   535\t# Clean stale temp files and directories from previous workers to avoid filling /tmp\n   536\tfind /tmp -mindepth 1 -maxdepth 1 -user \"$(whoami)\" -mmin +30 -not -name \"claude-*\" \\( -type f -delete -o -type d -exec rm -rf {} + \\) 2>/dev/null\n   537\t\n   538\t# Dispatch via darkfactory-dispatch: process supervisor with timeout, heartbeat, and structured JSON result\n   539\tDISPATCH_RESULT=$(darkfactory-dispatch \\\n   540\t  --model gpt-5.5 \\\n   541\t  --effort high \\\n   542\t  --timeout 1800 \\\n   543\t  --sandbox workspace-write \\\n   544\t  --config 'sandbox_workspace_write.writable_roots=[\".git\"]' \\\n   545\t  --prompt-file \"$BRIEF_PATH\" \\\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
