src/repositories/userRepo.ts\n    39\t- Endpoints: POST /api/users (body: {email: string, name: string}) → 201 {id, email, name}\n    40\t- Types: User {id: string, email: string, name: string, createdAt: Date}\n    41\t- Pattern: repository pattern via src/repositories/userRepo.ts\n    42\t\n    43\t### Task 2: Auth middleware\n    44\t- Created: src/middleware/requireAuth.ts, src/services/auth.ts\n    45\t- Exports: requireAuth (Express middleware, attaches req.user: User)\n    46\t- Endpoints: POST /api/auth/login (body: {email, password}) → 200 {token: string}\n    47\t>\n    48\t\n    49\t## Downstream Consumers\n    50\t<Which later tasks in tasks.md will call this code? For each, name one minimum integration test that proves the call path works. Leave empty if no later task consumes this one.>\n    51\t\n    52\t## Procedures\n    53\t- Use `/tdd` to implement this task\n    54\t- Commit all changes (code + tests) in a single commit with message: \"[task-N] <description>\"\n    55\t- Write your handoff report to openspec/changes/<change-name>/mission/handoffs/task-N.md\n    56\t\n    57\t## Handoff Report Format\n    58\t- Task: Task N - <name>\n    59\t- Commit SHA: <the full SHA>\n    60\t- Approach: <brief explanation of what you did and why>\n    61\t- Commands run: <any commands and their exit codes>\n    62\t- Concerns: <anything you're uncertain about>\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
