aws names from the glossary, worker briefs list Type Catalog entries, foundation audit checks task 1, module shape re-check verifies all names at the end\n    23\t\n    24\t### Requirement: UBIQUITOUS_LANGUAGE.md defines Domain type\n    25\tUBIQUITOUS_LANGUAGE.md SHALL include a \"Domain type\" term definition.\n    26\t\n    27\t#### Scenario: Domain type term present\n    28\t- **WHEN** a reader looks up \"Domain type\" in UBIQUITOUS_LANGUAGE.md\n    29\t- **THEN** the definition distinguishes domain types from technical helper types\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
